out.push(A('**2** **He has not tested with the optional second sensor fitted.** **Anybody running that should expect the loop to be longer and may need 4096.**'));
out.push(A('**3** ⚠ **The loop timing with the display redraw forced, and the revision number from the silkscreen.** **Those two things tell anybody reading whether it is this problem or a different one** — **and without them the thread produces four guesses, which is what happened the first time he asked.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 6 · Write with help (sample)'));
