out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('**Rows 2 on both cards lose nothing when the hedge goes** — ⚠ **_in the main_, _broadly_ and _to all intents and purposes_ are 10.4\'s padding and not hedges**, and that distinction is the one to insist on. **Rows 4 are made of words and travel unchanged.** **Rows 1, 3 and 5 are grammatical** — **and on row 5 of Card B the written-out version must name two readings, because _appears to_ hides a choice and not a doubt.**'));
