out.push(A('**One student reads _the certificate is needed within eleven days_ three times: flat, warmly, and as an instruction.** ⚠ **The words do not change and the room hears three different letters.** **That is what a translator chooses between when the target language has no flat form** — **except that they choose with words, and the choice is then in your document under your name.** **Close on Mrs Ajouz\'s sentence: four lines of thanks for a release that was nobody\'s favour.**'));
