out.push(NOTE('⚠ **Read the field headings aloud yourself and make the room say the assumption after each, because this is the only exercise in the book where the instrument is a teacher\'s voice.** _Date of qualification_ · one date. _Reason for return_ · one reason. _Name of referee_ · one person, who knows you, and who exists. **Three assumptions in three words on the last of those.** ⚠ **Then the thing that has to be said plainly or the cycle produces complaints instead of documents: the form cannot be changed and you will not be asked.** **A class that spends the cycle redesigning forms has done something enjoyable and useless** — **and Mr Shihabi\'s nine hundred one-source stories are the example to give, because the field is still there and the archive is still wrong.**'));
