out.push(SAMPLE(['The box said date of qualification, one line, and Mr Tayara\'s certificate is awarded in two stages: the written papers in one year and the practical in the next, and the school put the later date, which is what the ministry does. Mrs Tarabishi asked about the university, and it read the entry as a two-year gap in his education and asked what he had been doing: nothing the school wrote was wrong, and the form had one line and the thing has two dates. Mrs Oueidat said that is the commonest kind of problem in this work and the one nobody prepares for — it is not a problem of content, no amount of good writing touches it, the form cannot be changed, you are not going to be asked, and the second thing has to go somewhere a reader will actually meet it. Mrs Khoury said that is not the box and not a footnote, and three places work: the covering letter\'s first paragraph, a sentence inside an adjacent free-text field, or a separate sheet that the box itself points to. Mrs Ajouz said their forms have a field headed Reason for return with one line, and a file is almost always returned for two reasons, which is 8.4 arriving as a stationery problem. Dr Qabbani said their drug chart has one box for a decision and the decision has a time, and then the time goes in the box with the decision, in four characters. Mrs Khoury said a field heading is a sentence somebody wrote about what they expected, and reading it aloud tells you what it assumes. Mr Shihabi said their filing system has one field for a source, and every story has two or none, and the archive now says about nine hundred stories came from one person each, which is not true of any of them. Mrs Rizk asked what to do when the form is a donor\'s, and write in the box what the box can hold, and point. Mr Attar asked about a character limit, and that is the hardest case because you cannot point. Mr Zahreddine said his opinions are not on forms, and Mrs Khoury said the insurer\'s claim summary is a form and he has been filling in somebody\'s one-cause field for twenty years. And Mr Tayara said the thing he will take away is that the box was answered correctly: the only person who could have prevented it was him, with eleven words in a covering letter nobody had asked him for.']));
