out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are instructions about what to think and may not be written** — ⚠ **_robust_, _satisfactory_, _conservative_ and _exceptional_ are four readings asked for and not one of them is an absence.** **Rows 5 are the ones to praise**: both are absences stated as facts about the writer\'s own system, and both prevent a confident supply. **Collect the reasons attached to the instructions** — **an instruction with no reason is read as a preference about where to start.**'));
